// AWS IAM Login Profile Created  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1098, T1136.003
// Detects creation of a console login profile/password for an IAM user (CreateLoginProfile). Granting console access to a previously API-only…
// False positives: Legitimate onboarding granting console access to a user.
// Source: rules/persistence/iam-create-login-profile.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^CreateLoginProfile$/i eventSource=/^iam\.amazonaws\.com$/i
